        DISPOSITION_NDA record type and on the master Status__c field; it is only removed from
        THIS record type's allowed subset. Method__c and Party_Role__c are UNCHANGED by this
        amendment - both blocks below are untouched.

        WHY THIS HAPPENED URGENTLY (2026-08-27, corrective, same day as deploy
        0Afiw000000SIoPCAW): that deploy shipped a per-hop quick-action button,
        NDA__c.Move_to_Sent, gated to render on an Acquisition_NDA row at Status__c = 'Signed'
